# Web components (`web/**/*.tsx`)

Style: [front-end-cursor-rules.mdc](./front-end-cursor-rules.mdc). Open [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) only for routing/SEO/deal context.

## Design tokens (prefer over raw Tailwind)

```tsx
// ❌ border-slate-200/90 text-slate-700 bg-emerald-100
// ✅ border-border-subtle text-muted text-foreground bg-surface
// Actions: bg-accent · Positive data: deal-good · Surfaces: surface-hero | surface-panel | surface-inline
```

Typography: `text-display`, `text-data-hero`, `text-section-label`, `text-meta`.

## Structure

- Tool pages: `SiteHeader` / `AppHeader variant="tool"`; marketing home: `variant="marketing"`.
- Heavy clients: `dynamic()` or `loadToolPage()` from `lib/loadToolPage.tsx` (see `app/explore/page.tsx`).
- `<main id="main-content">` on page shells (skip link target).
- Event handlers: `handle` prefix. New TSX: **no semicolons**.

## i18n & a11y

- User-visible strings → `lib/i18n/` domain modules (`es` + `en` keys); import via `@/lib/i18n`. Footer/nav → `localePath(lang, path)`.
- Forms: visible labels or `sr-only` + `htmlFor`. Tables: `scope="col"` on `<th>`.
- Listing images: meaningful `alt` from title (or decorative `alt=""` only if title is adjacent).
- Interactive elements: `focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-accent/50` or `.link-focus`.

## UI primitives

Reuse `app/components/ui/` (`Button`, `Card`, `Badge`, `Field`) before bespoke styled elements.
